"text": "Our Core Values (Guidance Principles) We believe that every individual has the potential to learn and excel and must be given the chance for advancement. Our programs are geared toward affording every child and targeted individual the opportunity to learn and be transformed in order to eradicate illiteracy and poverty. Our Target REAP program is focus on High school graduates and high school dropped out with special need between ages 16 – 23 years. REAP highlights the security of youth, young adults, women farmers, at-risk youth, prostitute, etc; and provides trainings for church workers and other institutions that strive to promote professionalism, ethics and god governance."
